    "literalTranslation": "That is:—Cha mkufunzi mwanafunzi hali na akila hufa: cha mwanafunzi mkufunzi hula na akila hafi. Of the (food) of the teacher a pupil eats not, and, when he eats it, dies; of the (food) of the pupil the teacher eats, and when he eats, dies not.",
