    "languageName": "Kiswahili",
    "indigenous": "Mlinzi hulinda ndege: mke mzuri halindwi.",
    "literalTranslation": "The man that keeps the birds away (from the corn), keeps them away: (but) a pretty face (lit. woman) is not (to be) kept away.",
    "meaning": "The man that keeps the birds away (from the corn), keeps them away: (but) a pretty face (lit. woman) is not (to be) kept away.",
