    "languageId": "swahili",
    "languageName": "Kiswahili",
    "indigenous": "Mwenyi kutupa jongoo hutupa na ung'ongoe.",
    "literalTranslation": "The man that throws away a millipede, throws away the palm-leaf slip (with which he lifted it) as well.",
    "meaning": "There is no further use for the latter. An apology in answer to such a proverb as § 490.",
