    "languageName": "Mijikenda (Kinyika / Rabai)",
    "indigenous": "U nga nundu.",
    "literalTranslation": "You are like the bat.",
    "meaning": "Said to one to whom we should say, \"You are trying to sit on two stools at once.\"",
